abstract: >-
  data-center-siting-lab is a bounded public data center siting and large-load analysis repository built on the upstream reVeal package from NatLabRockies/reVeal. It adds public-data staging, proxy workflows, report-bundle generation, executive review artifacts, and explicit assumption contracts.
